# Frontend conventions

## Stack & imports

- React 18 functional components + hooks. No class components.
- Path alias `@` → `frontend/src` (see `vite.config.ts`).
- API calls go through `frontend/src/api/client.ts` (`api`,
  `liveVerificationApi`, `indicesApi`, `liveApi`). DO NOT call axios
  directly inside components.

## Styling

Use the design tokens from `tailwind.config.ts`:

- Surface: `bg`, `bg-surface`, `bg-elevated`
- Text: `fg`, `fg-muted`, `fg-subtle`
- Borders: `border`, `border-strong`
- Accents: `accent-{green,red,amber,blue,violet,cyan}`

Reusable component classes live in `frontend/src/index.css`:
`.card`, `.badge`, `.badge-{tone}`, `.btn`, `.btn-primary`, `.input`,
`.chip`, `.chip-active`, `.num` (tabular numerals).

Do NOT introduce raw hex colours in JSX.

## Numbers

Always format via `frontend/src/lib/format.ts`:

```tsx
import { fmt } from '@/lib/format';

<td className="num">{fmt.inr(price)}</td>      // OK
<td>Rs {price.toFixed(2)}</td>                 // BAD
```

## Server state

- TanStack Query 5 with **stable** query keys: `["screener"]`,
  `["screener-prices", symbols.join(',')]`, `["indices-dashboard"]`,
  `["live-verification-summary"]`, ...
- Live polling: see `Dashboard.tsx`/`Screener.tsx` for the
  `refetchInterval` + countdown pattern.
- Mutations: `queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [...] })` — never
  manually mutate cache.

## Routes

`/`, `/screener`, `/stock/:symbol`, `/indices`, `/indices/:symbol`,
`/live` — defined in `App.tsx`. Add new routes there and add a NavLink
in `components/Layout.tsx`.

The paper-trading routes (`/paper-trading`, `/paper-index-trading`) have
been removed. Do not reintroduce them.

## Type-check

Run `npx tsc --noEmit` after edits; `npm run build` before claiming a
change is done. Strict mode is enabled.
